              "type": "step",
              "id": "soulfaring:1xbtuio:1x68zfv",
              "html": "Kill <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Forgotten_Warrior\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vengeance</a> whenever she appears. Vengeance can drastically drain your stats so <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Super_restore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">super restores</a> can be useful. <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Deathtouched_dart\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Deathtouched darts</a> can be used. If you use <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Speed_III\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">speed III</a> on spare ritual space, and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Speed_II\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">speed II</a> or higher in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Necromancy_cape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">necromancy cape</a>, and never miss a shadow rift, you will only have to kill Vengeance once.",
